# Test files that run in the shared-worker "fast" project (vitest.config.ts):
# forks pool with isolate:false, so the TS import graph is paid once per worker
# instead of once per file (~2-3s/file on this suite).
#
# A file belongs here only if it keeps NO process-global footprint:
# - no startServer()/buildApp real-server boot
# - no child_process spawn/execFile
# - no initializeTelemetry/operationRegistry (process-global singletons)
# - no process.env mutation, vi.stubEnv, process.chdir
# - no vi.mock / fake timers (leak across files when isolation is off)
# Anything not listed runs in the default "isolated" project (fresh fork per
# file) — when in doubt, leave a new test file OFF this list; it just runs
# slower, never flakier.
